0-24T20:03:43+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Raj Shekhar Jha</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135172491,imgsize-95086.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[NMC weighs five-year rotation of HoDs after stakeholder feedback]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/nmc-weighs-five-year-rotation-of-hods-after-stakeholder-feedback/articleshow/135172062.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135172062.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[The National Medical Commission is considering an update to the rotation period for heads of departments in medical colleges. This revision aims to change the tenure from three years to five years based on stakeholder feedback. The original proposal also included both professors and eligible associate professors, which will now be restricted. A detailed response to an RTI application has confirmed that the proposal is still under consideration.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/nmc-weighs-five-year-rotation-of-hods-after-stakeholder-feedback/articleshow/135172062.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/nmc-weighs-five-year-rotation-of-hods-after-stakeholder-feedback/articleshow/135172062.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-24T19:43:43+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Anuja Jaiswal</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135172238,imgsize-99950.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[RML’s 666-bed super speciality block gets fire safety clearance, set to boost critical care]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/rmls-666-bed-super-speciality-block-gets-fire-safety-clearance-set-to-boost-critical-care/articleshow/135171939.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135171939.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Dr Ram Manohar Lohia Hospital's new 666-bed super speciality block has successfully secured fire safety clearance, allowing the hospital's capacity to soar past 2,200 beds. This cutting-edge facility will house numerous operation theatres along with specialized units for intensive and high dependency care, focusing on enhancing treatment, particularly in oncology. The timeline for when services will start is still pending.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/rmls-666-bed-super-speciality-block-gets-fire-safety-clearance-set-to-boost-critical-care/articleshow/135171939.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/rmls-666-bed-super-speciality-block-gets-fire-safety-clearance-set-to-boost-critical-care/articleshow/135171939.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-24T19:28:29+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Anuja Jaiswal</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135172041,imgsize-101846.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['We urge Indian businesses to continue and expand trade with Tehran': Envoy]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/we-urge-indian-businesses-to-continue-and-expand-trade-with-tehran-envoy/articleshow/135171796.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135171796.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/we-urge-indian-businesses-to-continue-and-expand-trade-with-tehran-envoy/articleshow/135171796.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/we-urge-indian-businesses-to-continue-and-expand-trade-with-tehran-envoy/articleshow/135171796.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-24T19:10:46+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Ismat Ara</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135171802,imgsize-58464.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[‘Do you support demand for free Kashmir?’ BJP questions Congress over MP Imran Masood’s Jamia visit amid student protests]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/do-you-support-demand-for-free-kashmir-bjp-questions-congress-over-mp-imran-masoods-jamia-visit-amid-student-protests/articleshow/135171264.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135171264.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/do-you-support-demand-for-free-kashmir-bjp-questions-congress-over-mp-imran-masoods-jamia-visit-amid-student-protests/articleshow/135171264.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/do-you-support-demand-for-free-kashmir-bjp-questions-congress-over-mp-imran-masoods-jamia-visit-amid-student-protests/articleshow/135171264.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-24T19:06:08+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Karan Manral</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135171783,imgsize-172314.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[45 paise for Rs 10 lakh cover: Railways extends insurance to counter tickets from October 27]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/45-paise-for-rs-10-lakh-cover-railways-extends-insurance-to-counter-tickets-from-october-27/articleshow/135171650.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135171650.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Starting October 27, Indian Railways will provide travelers the option to include an Optional Travel Insurance Scheme with their reservation ticket purchases. For a nominal fee of just 45 paise, passengers gain crucial coverage for accident-related incidents. The insurance offers various payout options tailored to medical and logistical emergencies. Reservation staff will be responsible for informing ticket buyers about this crucial add-on before finalizing bookings.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/45-paise-for-rs-10-lakh-cover-railways-extends-insurance-to-counter-tickets-from-october-27/articleshow/135171650.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/45-paise-for-rs-10-lakh-cover-railways-extends-insurance-to-counter-tickets-from-october-27/articleshow/135171650.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-24T19:05:15+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Arvind Chauhan</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135171751,imgsize-233184.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Amit Shah visits Delhi police headquarters amid law and order concerns]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/amit-shah-visits-delhi-police-headquarters-amid-law-and-order-concerns/articleshow/135171624.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135171624.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/amit-shah-visits-delhi-police-headquarters-amid-law-and-order-concerns/articleshow/135171624.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/amit-shah-visits-delhi-police-headquarters-amid-law-and-order-concerns/articleshow/135171624.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-24T18:55:52+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Aadrita Halder</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135171861,imgsi